usage: check-receipt.py [-h] [--expect-model-sha256 HEX]
                        [--expect-server-sha256 HEX]
                        [--expect-server-impl-sha256 HEX]
                        [--expect-install-tree-sha256 HEX]
                        [--expect-install-links-sha256 HEX]
                        [--expect-probe-sha256 HEX] [--expect-tool-sha256 HEX]
                        [--require-schema {v1,v2,v3}] [--selftest]
                        [receipt]

Validate kama-llamacpp-live/v1, /v2 and /v3 receipts.

positional arguments:
  receipt               receipt JSON path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --expect-model-sha256 HEX
                        require the recorded model sha256
  --expect-server-sha256 HEX
                        require the recorded server sha256
  --expect-server-impl-sha256 HEX
                        require the recorded server implementation library
                        sha256
  --expect-install-tree-sha256 HEX
                        require the recorded install-tree sha256
  --expect-install-links-sha256 HEX
                        require the recorded install-links (symlink) sha256
  --expect-probe-sha256 HEX
                        require the recorded probe sha256
  --expect-tool-sha256 HEX
                        require the recorded harness-tool sha256
  --require-schema {v1,v2,v3}
                        reject receipts below this schema version
  --selftest            run built-in valid/mutation matrix and exit
